{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01893","headline":"杂曲歌辞 独不见 · 王训","name":"杂曲歌辞 独不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日晚宜春暮，风輭上林朝。\n对酒近初节，开楼荡夜娇。\n石桥通小涧，竹路上青霄。\n持底谁见许，长愁成细腰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王训","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}